WEBVTT

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.440
<i>How long will I keep fighting...</i>

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.990
<i>within this blood-soaked vortex
of the battlefield?</i>

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.530
<i>How long will I keep protecting...</i>

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.370
<i>within these infinite killings
that will never end?</i>

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.880
<i>How long will I keep believing...</i>

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.130
<i>in this world filled
with deception and fabrication?</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
<i>How long will I keep telling lies...</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.190
<i>while continually feeling despair
at the bleak future?</i>

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.540
Lost 1D.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.710
Following regulations,
2B will assume the role of mission captain.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.930
Lost 4B.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:20.430
<i>Enemy units confirmed ahead.</i>

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.530
<i>Engaging combat
with a large enemy machine lifeform.</i>

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.950
<i>Requesting permission
to assume mobile configuration.</i>

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.580
<i>Permission granted.</i>

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.830
<i>2B to Operator 6O.</i>

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.240
<i>All other allied units have been lost.</i>

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.660
<i>I expect problems in executing the mission.
Awaiting orders.</i>

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:16.710
<i>O-Operator to 2B. Please rendezvous
with 9S onsite and gather terrain intel.</i>

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.010
<i>Afterwards, follow original plans.</i>

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.760
<i>Seek to destroy the target, the Goliath-class
weapon, and gather more information.</i>

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.800
<i>Roger.</i>

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.340
<i>- Standard comm systems down.
- Laser comm system activated.</i>

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.340
<i>- Heavy damage to Ho229 flight unit.
- Flight-control systems abandoned.</i>

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.180
<i>- Transferring IMU control.
- Activating FFCS.</i>

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.180
<i>- Confirming terrain... Long-range.
- Transferring FCS control.</i>

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.970
<i>- Initiating 2B vitals recheck sequence.
- Initiating short-range radio-wave camouflage.</i>

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.970
<i>- Confirming 2B black box signal.
- Activating NFCS.</i>

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.640
<i>Activating short-range attack gear.</i>

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:19.650
<i>Multiple enemy unit signals confirmed.</i>

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.400
I can see that.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:10.220
No matter how much you oil it up,
it won't come back to life.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:14.720
That should be it for disabling
the enemy base defense system...

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.060
Looks like...

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.900
it's about to begin.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:30.070
Just one unit? No ally units.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:35.910
<i>Operator 21O to 9S. Do you copy?</i>

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.290
Yup, yup! I hear you!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.040
<i>You only need to acknowledge once.</i>

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.130
Okay.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:45.590
<i>Confirmed infiltration of YoRHa Soldiers
into enemy base from a descent operation.</i>

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.010
<i>However, only one unit remains.</i>

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.260
That's quite an ordeal.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:53.510
<i>Contact with enemy defense weapons
confirmed.</i>

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.560
<i>Please head over to assist
the attack squadron that infiltrated.</i>

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.020
Roger that.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.400
And now...

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.650
Time to do my best at work!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.040
<i>Enemies destroyed.</i>

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.840
No.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.850
Is this...
the target Goliath-class weapon?

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:16.680
<i>Negative.</i>

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.600
<i>This enemy unit is not the target.</i>

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.390
<i>Quick eradication suggested.</i>

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.890
It's easy for you to say.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.150
Pod!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.650
Gather energy!
Close-range marksmanship mode at full power!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.990
<i>Warning: ordered...</i>

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.950
<i>Ordered attack
puts a high load on the chassis—</i>

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:38.870
Pod!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.750
Fire!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:59.560
<i>Thirteen hours and 34 minutes of cooldown time
required for another attack of a similar nature.</i>

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.060
<i>Confirmed enemy reboot.</i>

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.770
Fire missiles.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:25.500
It's dangerous
if you don't make sure they're dead.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.540
You're Miss 2B, right?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:34.970
I'm 9S. I was given orders to support you.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:35.930
Roger.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.600
So...

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:44.770
Is this giant buzz saw
the Goliath-class weapon that you're after?

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:48.060
It's not.
Looks like it's just a defense unit.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.320
Then it looks like
we have to search for the target.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:51.980
Yeah.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.740
And we'll destroy the core unit.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.400
Understood.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:00.280
I have a flight unit,
so I'll look around the perimeter.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.950
I'll investigate inside the facility.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.010
<i>This place in the past...</i>

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.220
<i>was supposedly
a weapons factory for humans.</i>

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.640
<i>The enemy seems
to be using this factory</i>

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.270
<i>to increase the production
of machine lifeforms.</i>

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.360
What's that?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.110
<i>No enemy signals in this area.</i>

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.990
<i>There seem to be more enemies
of this natures lately.</i>

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.150
<i>They just absentmindedly sit there.</i>

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.120
<i>I wonder what they’re doing?</i>

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:45.830
<i>There is no intel about sleep functions
in machine lifeforms from the analysis team.</i>

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.040
<i>And machine lifeforms,
unlike us androids, are simple—</i>

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:48.830
9S.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.540
Yes. What is it, Miss 2B?

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.790
<i>Is that story necessary
for this operation?</i>

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:57.630
Oh, I'm sorry. It's been quite a while
since I talked to anyone.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.170
That's right.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.760
<i>I'll send you the map data
that I collected earlier.</i>

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.510
Roger.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.770
Miss 2B. I'm happy.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.110
About what?

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:20.820
We Scanners usually work alone,
dealing with preliminary scouting.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.660
<i>I don't usually get a partner.
It's kind of fun!</i>

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.040
We are forbidden from harboring emotions.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.710
<i>Oh! I'm sorry.</i>

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:34.460
And... You don't have to call me "Miss."

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.340
<i>No honorifics are necessary for my name.</i>

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.050
Understood.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.300
<i>2B!</i>

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.680
<i>Is something the matter?</i>

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:49.520
It's nothing.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:01.900
<i>2B.</i>

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.070
<i>I have identified the location
of the enemy core unit.</i>

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.910
<i>I will guide you there.
Please keep proceeding forward.</i>

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:20.460
<i>Materials transferring
from Block 43 to 12.</i>

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.630
What's that?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:25.140
<i>They use data from the old world
to generate random nonsense.</i>

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:27.850
<i>Thank you for another day's hard work.
Please embrace the joys of labor.</i>

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.890
<i>There’s no meaning
behind what machine lifeforms do.</i>

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.350
This is strange.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:35.270
The core unit is there, but I couldn't
find any weapons that look like the target.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.320
Does that mean the intel from Command
was incorrect?

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.400
<i>We'll see about that.</i>

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:46.200
<i>The target core unit is below that.
Let's hurry.</i>

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.950
It's easy for you to say.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.040
Is that...

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.630
the core unit?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.090
<i>9S! The core unit is... outside...</i>

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.800
2B! What's wrong?

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.720
<i>Powerful jamming detected.</i>

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.470
At this timing?

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.810
<i>Alert. Enemy machine lifeforms.</i>

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.640
<i>Multiple units approaching.</i>

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.390
Don't get...

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.770
in our way!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.950
<i>Core unit signal increasing
from the building up ahead.</i>

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:28.950
Can it be...

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.620
<i>Target Goliath-class weapon found.</i>

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.150
Pod, request backup from Command!

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.910
<i>Communication is impossible
due to radio jamming.</i>

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.660
What the? Its movements...

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:17.290
<i>Target Goliath-class weapon
suspected to be incomplete.</i>

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.380
If that's the case...

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.590
I will destroy it here!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.650
Boost!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.150
9S.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:47.320
You brute force your way
through battles, 2B.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.660
<i>Confirmed functional decrease
of Goliath-class weapon.</i>

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.790
Leave this part to me.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.130
Hacking!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.130
<i>So this is the target
Goliath-class weapon...</i>

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.800
<i>To think about
going into battle against this solo...</i>

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.720
<i>I'm glad I made it in time.</i>

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.190
9S.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.980
Thank you.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.480
A protective wall?

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.410
So the protective wall is this trivial...

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:42.170
<i>Report. Enemy unit control infiltration route
and vulnerability found.</i>

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:45.250
Use that infiltration route
to run a suspension program.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.710
<i>Roger. Ten seconds until execution.</i>

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:51.720
The same type? What in the...

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.640
It's recovering
a lot faster than I thought!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.060
Watch out, 9S!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:12.660
<i>Target Goliath-class weapon
has temporarily ceased functions.</i>

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:17.790
<i>9S black box signal detected.
Not responding to communications.</i>

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.370
I have to save 9S!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.590
9S!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.180
I'll repair you right now!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:42.180
Pod! The staunching gel
and the logic-virus vaccine, and...

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:45.560
<i>The decrease in the subject's vitals cannot
be stopped with triage done at this—</i>

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.230
Shut up! Just give it to me!

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.280
2B... Just go...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.530
Stay quiet!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:01.040
We are soldiers.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.460
We must take pride in our battles.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:18.430
<i>Unit Ho229, accepting command 677.</i>

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.770
<i>Transferred authorized user from 9S to 2B.</i>

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:25.190
<i>Requesting acknowledgement from 2B.</i>

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:30.230
Please... Before the enemy reboots...

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.690
All right.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.090
<i>Confirmed decreasing vitals for 9S.</i>

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:59.470
Pod. You came at a good time.
Confirm the comm conditions.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:04.310
<i>Report. Radio jamming decreased
due to weakening of the enemy.</i>

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:07.390
<i>Though unstable, laser comm is possible.</i>

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:12.360
Take 2B's record data package...

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.990
Kill... Kill...

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.330
These beams...

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.120
And it's speaking words...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.590
Pod! How are the controls?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.750
<i>Behavior table adjusted.</i>

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:36.720
<i>Balance controls overridden.</i>

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.680
<i>Enemy unit subjugation complete.</i>

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.930
Pod! Disable subjugation
for three seconds!

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.220
<i>Roger.</i>

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.770
<i>Initiating re-subjugation.</i>

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.450
Kill...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.120
Kill...

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.830
Kill...

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.920
Just break down already!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:44.070
You really do brute-force it, 2B.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.740
Request support... from Command...

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.000
No, that doesn't...

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.080
seem necessary.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.000
Kill...

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.630
Kill...

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:00.630
- Kill...
- Impossible.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.680
Looks like things...

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:06.100
aren't going so well.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.680
I'm done setting up.

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:11.810
Your black box, please.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.270
All right.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:27.160
Requesting annihilation of enemy
Goliath-class weapon via black box reaction!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:31.120
<i>Request... Accepted.</i>

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.000
2B.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:38.590
It was an honor to fight alongside you.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.300
The honor was mine.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:52.810
<i>All existence is designed
to become extinct.</i>

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.360
THIRTEENTH ORBITING SATELLITE BASE
THE BUNKER

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:59.320
<i>We are perpetually trapped
in a never-ending spiral of life and death.</i>

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.990
<i>Is this a curse... or is it punishment?</i>

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.870
<i>However...</i>

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:10.580
<i>If I am allowed to,
I would like to make a wish.</i>

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.500
<i>For his happiness.</i>

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.250
<i>That is my...</i>

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:21.800
The operation was a success.

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:25.760
The enemy Goliath-class weapon was destroyed,
and the enemy-occupied territory—

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.220
9S.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.050
Yes?

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:34.310
Thank you for uploading our data
to the Bunker at the very end.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:40.570
I'm sorry.
I don't have memories about that.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:46.360
I likely only had enough time
to back up your data.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.570
My memories

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:51.870
only go back to the point
right before our rendezvous.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.210
I see.

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.630
Glory to mankind.

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:02.210
Glory... to mankind.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:21.520
<i>Pod 042 reporting to all of mankind.</i>

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:24.740
<i>We will now execute the task</i>

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.740
<i>of introducing the multiple endings
of the video game "NieR:Automata.” Over.</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:32.830
PUPPET PLAY
NIER:AUTOMATA
“2B AND 9S”

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.500
Yes, yes! Hello!

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:41.290
We are androids who fight for mankind day in
and day out, YoRHa No. 9 Type S AKA 9S and...

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:44.380
Likewise, YoRHa No. 2 Type B AKA 2B.

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:49.260
We'll get right into it. The game
"NieR:Automata" has multiple endings,

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:51.220
and there really are a lot of them!

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:56.390
So in this segment, we will show you
the many endings in a slightly different way!

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.060
9S, we should start off
by introducing ourselves a bit more.

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.060
Nice assist, Miss 2B!

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:06.190
Well, we YoRHa model androids
have various types,

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:06.570
ALL SORTS OF TYPES?
YoRHa MODELS

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:13.240
like "A" for Attacker, "B" for Battler,
"D," "G," "H," "O," and "S" for Scanner like me.

00:23:06.740 --> 00:23:08.150
ATTACKER TYPE - TYPE A

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:09.280
BATTLE TYPE - TYPE B

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:09.740
DEFENSE TYPE - TYPE D

00:23:09.740 --> 00:23:10.200
GUNNER TYPE - TYPE G

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:10.660
HEALER TYPE - TYPE H

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.620
OPERATOR TYPE - TYPE O

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:12.870
SCANNER TYPE - TYPE S

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:14.990
HIDDEN TYPE - ?

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:15.910
There may even be other hidden models.

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:19.460
Miss 2B's "2" designates
the rollout order for her type.

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:23.420
I am an ordinary combat model
integrating Type A and Type G.

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:27.380
And only the YoRHa models
are equipped with this black box!

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:30.260
This actually has a really amazing feature.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:31.390
Miss 2B? Hey, w—

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:36.180
By self-destructing at the Bunker, the entire structure
ended up exploding in a spectacular fashion.
But hey, it sure did look pretty from Earth!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.020
TO BE CONTINUED
